  "body": "Set on an elevated 511sqm section backing directly onto a native reserve, this spacious family home offers a combination of privacy, peaceful green outlooks, and flexible living. With no rear neighbours, you will enjoy a serene bush backdrop and a true sense of space.\r\n\r\n• Elevated 511sqm site with uninterrupted native reserve views.\r\n\r\n• Light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area with seamless indoor-outdoor flow.\r\n\r\n• Contemporary kitchen featuring a generous island bench, walk-in pantry, and ample storage.\r\n\r\n• Spacious Kwila deck is perfect for entertaining, family BBQs, or simply relaxing while enjoying the peaceful reserve outlook.\r\n\r\n• Upstairs includes a private master with an ensuite, walk-in wardrobe, and bush views, plus three additional bedrooms, a family bathroom, and a study nook.\r\n\r\n• Ground floor offers two bedrooms, a full bathroom, and a large separate living room, ideal for extended family, teenagers, guests, or working from home, with excellent granny potential.\r\n\r\nJust a short drive from Silverdale shopping, local cafés, great schools, motorway access, and Orewa Beach.\r\nCall us now to arrange a private viewing.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
